# EmailJS Configuration for Contact Me form
# Create an account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 1. Create an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> get Service ID
# 2. Create an Email Template -> get Template ID
#    Recommended template variables: {{name}}, {{email}}, {{phone}}, {{service}}, {{budget}}, {{country}}, {{message}}
# 3. Account Settings -> API Keys -> get Public Key
